# 统一换行符，避免 Windows/Linux 协作时整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 这些必须保持二进制，别被当文本处理
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
*.docx binary
*.apk  binary
*.exe  binary
*.keystore binary

# 对外文档在 GitHub 上按 Markdown 显示，diff 里也算文本
*.md   text eol=lf
*.ps1  text eol=lf
*.cs   text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.xml  text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
